  "description": "Bibui.Core, the core of bibui, a code-first native UI library: nodes, layout, the painter and its DrawList, text, theming, the runtime (BibuiRuntime: BeginBuild/EndBuild, input) and the components. Add Bibui.Platform.Silk (GLFW + OpenGL, cross-platform) or Bibui.Platform.Wayland for a window, and Bibui.Raster.Skia (SkiaSharp) or Bibui.Raster.Managed.Backend to draw the DrawList.",
